  "description": "The all-new Monday Motorbikes Anza V4 takes the spirit of the classic cruiser into a new era of electric freedom. Sleek, refined, and built with purpose, it’s designed for riders who want more than transportation. They want every ride to feel smooth, confident, and alive.\nWith front fork suspension, a rear mono shock with adjustable stiffness and rebound, a narrower frame, and an eight-speed derailleur for more efficient pedaling, the Anza V4 is made to move with you. Four-piston hydraulic brakes deliver strong, controlled stopping power, giving you the confidence to ride through city streets, campus routes, work commutes, and spontaneous afternoon escapes.\nBuilt for the long run, the Anza V4 is engineered for riders who value freedom, durability, and the simple joy of getting out on the road.",
